  "methodology": {
    "en": "One ERC-20 Transfer log from an issuer-listed contract, identified by chain, transaction hash and log index. Minting and burning are classified by the zero address. Fee and zero-amount transfer events are included. An onchain transfer alone does not establish a sale or an offchain settlement. Ethereum 2026-08-14 – 2026-11-26 · BNB Chain 2026-11-24 – 2026-11-26",
    "zh": "以链 ID、交易哈希和日志序号识别发行方合约的每条 Transfer 事件。按零地址区分铸造、销毁及普通转移，含手续费及零金额转移事件。仅凭链上转移无法确认是否产生成交或链下结算。各链覆盖区间为 Ethereum 2026-08-14 – 2026-11-26 · BNB Chain 2026-11-24 – 2026-11-26"
  },
  "analysis": {
    "en": "13 active contracts cover gold, Treasuries, tokenized equities and funds. XAUT accounts for 53.9% of the archived events. Shares measure activity within these block ranges.",
